  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed removal of T1 (Swamp Cypress) is refused as the tree makes a significant contribution to the visual amenity of the area. Insufficient evidence has been submitted to demonstrate that the tree is causing structural damage or that its condition justifies removal. Localised limb failure does not warrant the loss of the entire tree, particularly where lesser management options are available. In the absence of robust supporting evidence, the proposal would result in unjustified harm to local amenity."
